  "note": ["The blossom environment (ps-bop.3.9: a cherry-blossom temple at dusk; mid-value pink): the arena's area plan in POLYGON Samurai's temple grounds: cherry trees and bamboo groves for the forest, bushes, bamboo, stone lanterns, zen rocks and Elven Realm's white statues and lamp posts for the edge bands, flowers and stepping stones on pale white-stone fighting ground, a petal-pink floor under the trees. A great cherry tree for the glowing tree, a ring of stone lanterns, a shrine with its guardian lions for the graveyard, bamboo fences for the ruin walls and the courtyard (Elven statues on plinths at its corners), stone braziers in the brazier glade, a torii at the opening. A soft rose key on the set and a white one on the horde, a mauve skylight, warm lantern pools, rose fog and a mauve grade. Its palette and findings: demo3d/evidence/look/env-blossom/README.md. Format: arena-layout.json's note, Environments."],
